<title>USA: Novo Nordisk files suit against Becton Dickinson.</title>
<headline>Novo Nordisk files suit against Becton Dickinson.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Novo Nordisk AS said Wednesday it filed a patent infringement lawsuit against Becton Dickinson and Co.</p>
<p>The suit was filed in U.S. District Court for the Southern District of New York and relates to Novo Nordisk's &quot;NovoPen&quot; insulin delivery system sold in the United States.  </p>
<p>Becton Dickson was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
